## The machine is the relay's (port/web/fly.toml), whose packets are a game's:
## this takes its one CPU only when the relay leaves it (fly_start.sh runs it
## at the lowest priority too).

## one scheduler (the machine has one CPU), and one for long native calls
+S 1:1
+SDcpu 1:1

## a scheduler with nothing to do sleeps at once: by default it spins for a
## while first, looking for work
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
